{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40471","headline":"送陈樵校书归泉州 · 曹松","name":"送陈樵校书归泉州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巨塔列名题，诗心亦罕齐。\n除官京下阙，乞假海门西。\n别席侵残漏，归程避战鼙。\n关遥秦鴈断，家近瘴云低。\n候马春风馆，迎船晓月溪。\n帝京须早入，莫被刺桐迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40471.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40471","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}